      ],
      "en": "Surely God is good to Israel, to those who are pure in heart.",
      "ko": "하나님이 참으로 이스라엘 중 마음이 정결한 자에게 선을 행하시나",
      "source_text_hash": "357c8809e403a5d7603dda4f1126097902af5fee289ac5ee73d170fd3f9ac777",
      "translation_text_hash": "b2d56c279169caef4155271720f66fed9433e4a20e582daec25131610d54af23",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
