        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 73,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "But as for me, my feet were almost gone. My steps had nearly slipped.",
      "ko": "나는 거의 실족할뻔 하였고 내 걸음이 미끄러질뻔 하였으니",
      "source_text_hash": "25efceaca8ce6a9c669a5809fee0d10f0bf18cd610f0fa0253b10374f4805639",
      "translation_text_hash": "be3369e2937bb3ed65d62baa84be917ecf46f98c8191a20dac16bd847379addd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "나는 거의 실족할뻔 하였고 내 걸음이 미끄러질뻔 하였으니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "be3369e2937bb3ed65d62baa84be917ecf46f98c8191a20dac16bd847379addd"
      ]
    },
    {
