      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 73,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "For I was envious of the arrogant, when I saw the prosperity of the wicked.",
      "ko": "이는 내가 악인의 형통함을 보고 오만한 자를 질시하였음이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "448388b35dbff36bfa1c347dd3fa3c367e1c3d779ed0966e2e4deb1746ea3565",
      "translation_text_hash": "118edc7b86168d3b33fa8e1eb86e9a110468a97dcb28ceec51bf00d685c039fc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이는 내가 악인의 형통함을 보고 오만한 자를 질시하였음이로다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "118edc7b86168d3b33fa8e1eb86e9a110468a97dcb28ceec51bf00d685c039fc"
      ]
    },
