      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 73,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "For there are no struggles in their death, but their strength is firm.",
      "ko": "저희는 죽는 때에도 고통이 없고 그 힘이 건강하며",
      "source_text_hash": "353163c240df88c6dc21d305f9a352c0493faa8810509e856a6369fe3bebfacd",
      "translation_text_hash": "00b0976718696c90237ff8c61afeb92341f5c1b600cccab301ccdd9c5d2e2c7a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
