      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 73,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "They scoff and speak with malice. In arrogance, they threaten oppression.",
      "ko": "저희는 능욕하며 악하게 압제하여 말하며 거만히 말하며",
      "source_text_hash": "787df968180771f8886eee8f3d8568108cd854194e987bc8a1b8e5b63c19ed41",
      "translation_text_hash": "9ba1fadcfc0e2655bb382563f45b6f742e18dffeb62be94a79319351ac6aeae2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
