      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 73,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "Therefore their people return to them, and they drink up waters of abundance.",
      "ko": "그러므로 그 백성이 이리로 돌아와서 잔에 가득한 물을 다 마시며",
      "source_text_hash": "c83bc417bc85b5c2a98fe10d3df8fe6ed795ace7144d99ea32c59d3ff64beeb3",
      "translation_text_hash": "8462edba707eaee9b4f79dc8966747fe6d58da2b9ebf3dec39104edf517c1801",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
