      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 73,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "Behold, these are the wicked. Being always at ease, they increase in riches.",
      "ko": "볼지어다 이들은 악인이라 항상 평안하고 재물은 더 하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "88faebdb35ab2a60a85b289f977aa6bdaf8642d7237af0a7d561c1e13cf06cf9",
      "translation_text_hash": "9acbef6096f15617bbea32ace6a09eb851bc3b1b01d80167fdfc7a5172bf6ced",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
