        "verse": 16
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 73,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "When I tried to understand this, it was too painful for me—",
      "ko": "내가 어찌면 이를 알까 하여 생각한즉 내게 심히 곤란하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "3337b9c1500c0c0a26463cba27e60fba727729718970cd428daf2f55dca8d723",
